      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Dashboards\n- [Executive Summary](#/d/exec-summary/executive-summary3a-macos-system)\n- [Mac System: Core Health](#/d/mac-system-all/mac-system3a-core-health)\n- [Mac Network: Connectivity & Wi‑Fi](#/d/mac-network/mac-network3a-connectivity-and-wie28091-fi)\n- [Mac Info: Identity & Status](#/d/mac-info/mac-info3a-identity-and-status)\n- [All Metrics: Live Explorer](#/d/all-metrics-full/all-metrics3a-live-explorer)\n\n**Retention:** 14 days, 20 GB cap.",
        "mode": "markdown"
